SUMMARY:Adam Ray: WHO IS ME Tour LIVE at San Jose Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nAdam Ray is a Los Angeles-based stand-up comedian\, actor\, and podcaster best known for his uncanny celebrity impressions and razor-sharp observational humor. He has appeared on The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon\, Conan\, and The Late Late Show with James Corden\, and is widely recognized for his viral Dr. Phil impression that has amassed tens of millions of views online. \nBeyond stand-up\, Adam is the host of the wildly popular podcast About Last Night\, where he interviews celebrities and fellow comedians in his signature unfiltered style. His comedy blends pop culture commentary\, self-deprecating humor\, and spot-on impressions that leave audiences in stitches from start to finish. \nThe WHO IS ME Tour is Adam Ray’s latest headline touring show — a fully realized stand-up hour that dives deep into his personal life\, Hollywood observations\, and the absurdity of modern existence. Fans can expect a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud performance packed with new material and crowd-pleasing moments. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, CA 95113\nAge Restriction: 21+ (Valid photo ID required)\nContent: Adult language and themes\nTwo-item minimum purchase required in the showroom\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe San Jose Improv is one of the Bay Area’s premier comedy clubs\, located in the heart of downtown San Jose at 62 S Second St. Part of the nationally renowned Improv Comedy Club chain\, the San Jose location has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up comedy for decades. \nThe intimate club-style venue seats approximately 250 guests in a general admission\, first-come-first-served format\, with premium booth and table options available for those seeking a more elevated experience. The layout ensures that every seat in the house offers an excellent sightline to the stage\, creating an up-close and personal comedy experience. \nThe venue features a full bar and food menu\, with a mandatory two-item minimum per guest in the showroom. Parking is available in nearby downtown San Jose garages and street parking. The club is easily accessible via public transit\, just steps from the San Jose Diridon Station area and downtown light rail stops. \nWhat to Expect\nAdam Ray’s WHO IS ME Tour is a solo headline stand-up show featuring approximately 75-90 minutes of new material. The show is a full evening of comedy — no opening act filler\, just Adam Ray delivering his best work in an intimate club setting. \nExpect a mix of celebrity impression segments\, personal storytelling\, and sharp observational comedy. Adam’s high-energy stage presence and natural crowd interaction make every show feel unique and spontaneous. This is a 21+ event\, so the material is unfiltered and adult-oriented. \nSeating is general admission\, so arriving early is recommended to secure the best seats. Premium VIP booths and tables are available for purchase and include food and beverage credits. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $37.17 – $107.72 (includes fees) \nTickets are available through official channels and resale platforms. Purchase early as this show is expected to sell out. \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/adam-ray-who-is-me-tour-live-at-san-jose-improv/
LOCATION:San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, California\, 95113\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://i.ticketweb.com/i/00/13/46/56/13_Edp.jpg?v=5
