SUMMARY:Bill Burr Live at Dolby Live Las Vegas
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nBill Burr is one of the most celebrated stand-up comedians of his generation — a fearless\, brutally honest performer whose comedy cuts through the noise with razor-sharp observations about modern life\, masculinity\, relationships\, and society. Known for his explosive delivery and willingness to tackle any topic\, Burr has earned a massive global fanbase and is widely regarded as one of the greatest stand-up comedians working today. \nBill is the creator and star of the animated Netflix series F Is for Family\, a recurring cast member on Breaking Bad and The Mandalorian\, and has released multiple critically acclaimed stand-up specials on Netflix including Paper Tiger\, Walk Your Way Out\, and I’m Sorry You Feel That Way. His Monday Morning Podcast is one of the most downloaded comedy podcasts in the world. \nSeeing Bill Burr live at Dolby Live in Las Vegas is a bucket-list comedy experience. His large-venue shows are legendary — high-energy\, unpredictable\, and absolutely hilarious from start to finish. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: Dolby Live at Park MGM\, 3770 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes\nImportant: This is a phone-free experience. All phones will be secured in Yondr pouches upon entry. Ticket resale is not permitted for this event.\n\nAbout the Venue\nDolby Live at Park MGM is one of Las Vegas’s premier entertainment venues\, located at 3770 S Las Vegas Blvd inside the Park MGM resort. With a capacity of approximately 5\,200 guests\, Dolby Live is an intimate arena-style venue that delivers an exceptional concert and comedy experience with world-class acoustics and sightlines. \nThe venue features state-of-the-art Dolby Atmos sound technology\, making it one of the best-sounding rooms in Las Vegas. The layout includes floor seating\, reserved lower bowl seats\, and upper level sections\, all designed to provide an immersive experience. Full bar and concession service is available throughout the venue. \nPark MGM is conveniently located on the Las Vegas Strip with valet and self-parking available. The venue is easily accessible from the Strip and connected to the T-Mobile Arena via the Park entertainment district. \nWhat to Expect\nBill Burr’s Las Vegas show is a full-scale stand-up production at one of the Strip’s most impressive venues. Expect a high-energy\, no-holds-barred performance covering everything from current events to personal stories\, all delivered with Burr’s signature intensity and comedic genius. \nThis is a phone-free event — all phones will be placed in Yondr pouches at the door\, creating an undistracted\, fully present audience experience that makes the show even more electric. Anyone seen using a device during the performance will be escorted out. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes. This is a rare opportunity to see one of comedy’s biggest stars in an intimate arena setting in Las Vegas — don’t miss it. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: From $133 (fees may apply) \nNote: Ticket resale is NOT approved for this event. Only official Ticketmaster tickets are valid. Do not purchase from unauthorized resellers. \nTickets are available exclusively through Ticketmaster. This show is expected to sell out — secure your seats now! \nOfficial Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/bill-burr-live-at-dolby-live-las-vegas/
