SUMMARY:Aries Spears LIVE at The Factory
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Aries Spears\nAries Spears is one of the most versatile and electrifying comedians working today. Born in Chicago and raised in New Jersey\, Aries has been performing stand-up since the age of 14\, building a reputation as a fearless\, no-holds-barred comedian with an extraordinary gift for impressions and character work. \nHe is best known for his eight seasons on the legendary sketch comedy series MAD TV\, where his dead-on impressions of Michael Jackson\, Kanye West\, Eddie Murphy\, Shaquille O’Neal\, and many others made him one of the show’s most beloved cast members. His stand-up specials include Hollywood\, Look I’m Smiling (Showtime\, 2011) and Comedy Blueprint (2016)\, both showcasing his raw\, unfiltered comedic style. \nAries brings an explosive energy to every live performance — expect rapid-fire impressions\, sharp social commentary\, and crowd interaction that keeps the entire room on its feet. This is a must-see show for any comedy fan. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nDoors Open: 7:00 PM\nShow Time: 8:00 PM\nVenue: The Factory\, 17105 North Outer 40 Road\, Chesterfield\, MO 63141\nAge Restriction: All Ages\nTicket Prices: $35 – $103 \nAbout The Factory\nThe Factory is one of St. Louis’s premier mid-size entertainment venues\, located in Chesterfield\, Missouri — just a short drive from downtown St. Louis. With a capacity of approximately 2\,500\, The Factory offers an intimate yet energetic atmosphere that’s perfect for stand-up comedy shows. \nThe venue features excellent sightlines from virtually every angle\, a full bar and concessions\, and a general admission floor with reserved seating options available. The sound system is top-notch\, ensuring every punchline lands crystal clear. Parking is available on-site\, with premium parking passes available for purchase. \nThe Factory has quickly become one of the most beloved live entertainment destinations in the St. Louis metro area\, hosting national touring acts across comedy\, music\, and more. \nWhat to Expect\nAries Spears delivers a high-octane\, laugh-out-loud performance from the moment he hits the stage. His live show is a masterclass in stand-up comedy — blending sharp observational humor\, fearless social commentary\, and his legendary celebrity impressions into a seamless\, non-stop comedic experience. \nExpect adult language and mature themes throughout. Aries doesn’t pull punches — his comedy is raw\, real\, and relentlessly funny. Whether you’ve been a fan since his MAD TV days or you’re discovering him for the first time\, this show will leave you in tears from laughing. \nArrive early to grab drinks and get your spot. Doors open at 7:00 PM\, one hour before showtime. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $35 to $103 depending on seat location. Official tickets are available through Ticketmaster. Resale tickets are available through VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/aries-spears-live-at-the-factory/
LOCATION:The Factory\, 17105 North Outer 40 Road\, Chesterfield\, MO\, 63005\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/fe8/f5d847b2-3439-4e8f-8b98-efc6f1cb9fe8_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
