SUMMARY:Nikki Glaser: The Stunning Tour LIVE at Hard Rock Live at Etess Arena
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nNikki Glaser: The Stunning Tour LIVE at Hard Rock Live at Etess Arena\nOne of comedy’s sharpest and most fearless voices\, Nikki Glaser\, brings her headline The Stunning Tour to the Hard Rock Live at Etess Arena in Atlantic City on Saturday\, August 1\, 2026. Known for her razor-sharp wit\, unfiltered honesty\, and bold comedic style\, Nikki delivers a live show that is equal parts hilarious and unforgettable. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: Hard Rock Live at Etess Arena\nAddress: 1000 Boardwalk\, Atlantic City\, NJ 08401\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome (under 18 must be accompanied by an adult)\nParking: \nAbout Nikki Glaser\nNikki Glaser is one of the most celebrated stand-up comedians working today\, known for her Netflix specials\, hosting the Golden Globes\, and her wildly popular podcast. Her comedy is bold\, personal\, and brilliantly crafted — earning her a devoted global fanbase. The Stunning Tour is her most ambitious live show yet\, showcasing her at the absolute top of her game. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full evening of Nikki Glaser’s signature unfiltered stand-up comedy\nNew material from her latest tour\, The Stunning Tour\nHilarious\, honest\, and deeply relatable storytelling\nAn electric atmosphere at one of Atlantic City’s premier entertainment venues\nA night you’ll be talking about long after the show ends\n\nVenue Information\n \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $49 with VIP meet-and-greet packages also available. Secure your seats now before they sell out — this show is expected to be a sellout! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nikki-glaser-the-stunning-tour-live-at-hard-rock-live-at-etess-arena/
