SUMMARY:Josh Johnson's Comedy Band Camp LIVE at Taft Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Josh Johnson\nJosh Johnson is a critically acclaimed stand-up comedian and writer best known for his work on The Daily Show with Trevor Noah. His sharp\, incisive comedy tackles race\, politics\, and culture with a wit and intelligence that has earned him widespread acclaim. His Comedy Band Camp is a unique live event that blends stand-up with a curated lineup of comedic talent. \nJosh’s comedy is thoughtful\, precise\, and brilliantly funny — the kind of stand-up that makes you laugh and think at the same time. His Comedy Band Camp format promises a full evening of top-tier comedy from multiple performers\, making it one of the most exciting shows of the summer. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nTime: 8:30 PM (Late Show) — Early show at 5:00 PM also available\nVenue: Taft Theatre\nAddress: 317 East 5th Street\, Cincinnati\, OH 45202 \nAbout Taft Theatre\nTaft Theatre is one of Cincinnati’s most beloved historic venues\, originally opened in 1928. With a capacity of approximately 2\,500\, it offers an intimate and elegant atmosphere that makes every performance feel special. The theatre’s ornate interior\, excellent acoustics\, and central downtown location make it a favorite for both performers and audiences. \nLocated at 317 East 5th Street in downtown Cincinnati\, Taft Theatre is surrounded by restaurants and parking options. Note: there are no elevators in the theatre\, and balcony seats require climbing stairs. \nWhat to Expect\nJosh Johnson’s Comedy Band Camp is a multi-comedian showcase running approximately 2 hours. Expect Josh Johnson headlining alongside a hand-picked lineup of talented comedians for a full evening of laughs. This is a unique format that delivers more comedy per dollar than almost any other show on tour. \nDoors open at 7:30 PM for the late show. Arrive early to grab drinks and find your seats. An early show at 5:00 PM is also available on the same date. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $35 – $85 (plus fees) \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-johnsons-comedy-band-camp-live-at-taft-theatre/
LOCATION:Taft Theatre\, 317 East 5th Street\, Cincinnati\, Ohio\, 45202\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/a1f/6aec4b02-7063-4485-bcc9-242f0eef6a1f_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
