SUMMARY:Mike E. Winfield LIVE at Chicago Improv
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nMike E. Winfield is one of the most beloved and relatable stand-up comedians working today. Known for his warm\, self-deprecating humor and his ability to find comedy in the everyday struggles of family life\, Winfield has built a devoted national following through his live performances and television appearances. \nHe is best known for his breakout moment on America’s Got Talent Season 17\, where he wowed the judges to a standing ovation and four yes votes. He returned for America’s Got Talent: All-Stars\, where Simon Cowell hit the Golden Buzzer for his performance. His signature “StepMAN” bit about being a stepdad has become a fan favorite and anchors his Amazon Original special Mike E. Winfield: StepMan. \nWinfield has also appeared on The Late Show with David Letterman\, Showtime’s Comics Without Borders\, Comicview on BET\, and Comedy Central’s Live at Gotham. He starred in the feature film PIMP opposite Keke Palmer and the late DMX. His comedy is clean\, family-friendly\, and packed with sharp observations about real life. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Sunday\, August 2\, 2026\nShow Time: 6:00 PM CDT (Doors open at 4:00 PM)\nVenue: Chicago Improv\nAddress: 5 Woodfield Mall K120B\, Schaumburg\, IL 60173\nAge Restriction: 21+ only. Valid ID required at entry.\nTicket Prices: $20 GA (plus fees)\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase per person in the showroom. No photography or video recording during the show. All sales are final.\n\nAbout the Venue\nChicago Improv is the Chicago area’s premier comedy club\, located inside the Woodfield Mall in Schaumburg\, Illinois — just 30 miles northwest of downtown Chicago. Part of the nationally recognized Improv comedy club chain\, Chicago Improv has hosted some of the biggest names in stand-up comedy for decades. \nThe showroom features general admission seating with host-escorted placement\, ensuring every guest gets a great view of the stage. The intimate club atmosphere puts you right in the middle of the action\, with a full bar and a mandatory two-item minimum per guest. VIP and premium booth seating is available for groups\, offering a more exclusive experience. \nThe venue is easily accessible from I-90 and Route 53\, with ample parking available throughout the Woodfield Mall complex. The surrounding mall offers plenty of dining and shopping options for a complete night out in the suburbs. Chicago Improv is a 21+ venue for all shows. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headlining stand-up performance by Mike E. Winfield. Expect a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud evening filled with his signature storytelling about family life\, relationships\, and the hilarious challenges of being a stepdad. Winfield’s comedy is warm\, relatable\, and endlessly funny — the kind of show that leaves you quoting jokes for weeks. \nWinfield is known for his incredible crowd work and his ability to connect with every person in the room. His shows feel personal and spontaneous\, even when delivering polished material. This is a rare chance to see one of comedy’s most beloved performers in an intimate club setting. Arrive early to grab a drink and a great seat before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice: $20 GA (plus $7.02 fees\, including tax — total $27.02) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). This is a 21+ event. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/mike-e-winfield-live-at-chicago-improv/
LOCATION:Chicago Improv\, 5 Woodfield Mall\, Schaumburg\, IL\, 60173\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/23_Edp-2j70TM.png
GEO:42.0453811;-88.0375314
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Chicago Improv 5 Woodfield Mall Schaumburg IL 60173 USA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=5 Woodfield Mall:geo:-88.0375314,42.0453811
END:VEVENT
