SUMMARY:Chazz Hawkins LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club - Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\nChazz Hawkins LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nGet ready for a hilarious night as Chazz Hawkins takes the stage at Punch Line Comedy Club in Sacramento! Known for his sharp wit and relatable storytelling\, Chazz delivers a high-energy stand-up performance you won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 2\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person \nAbout Chazz Hawkins\nChazz Hawkins is a rising stand-up comedian known for his energetic performances and sharp observational humor. He has been making waves on the comedy circuit with his unique perspective on everyday life\, earning fans across the country with his authentic and hilarious storytelling style. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy performance\nSharp observational humor and relatable storytelling\nIntimate club atmosphere at one of Sacramento’s premier comedy venues\nFull bar service with 2-beverage minimum\nAn unforgettable night of laughs\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento is located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, CA. One of the top comedy clubs in Northern California\, it features a full bar\, great sightlines\, and ample free parking in the shopping center lot. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $39. This is an 18+ event with a 2-beverage minimum per person. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/chazz-hawkins-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
