SUMMARY:Whindersson Nunes LIVE at Wells Hall at The Parker
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n \nWhindersson Nunes LIVE at Wells Hall at The Parker\nBrazilian comedy superstar Whindersson Nunes returns to the United States with his brand-new tour\, “Isso Definitivamente Não é um Culto” (“This Is Definitely Not a Cult”)\, bringing his unique blend of smart comedy\, personal stories\, and improvisation to Fort Lauderdale for one exclusive night. Known for his authentic and unpredictable style\, Whindersson delivers a powerful live experience filled with laughter\, connection\, and unforgettable moments. This performance will be spoken in Portuguese. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 2\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Wells Hall at The Parker (Lillian S. Wells Hall)\nAddress: 707 NE 8th Street\, Fort Lauderdale\, FL 33304\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome\nLanguage: Performance in Portuguese \nAbout Whindersson Nunes\nWhindersson Nunes is one of the biggest Brazilian comedians in the world\, recognized for his unique\, authentic\, and unpredictable comedic style. After 4 years away from the U.S.\, he returns with a brand-new tour that combines smart comedy\, personal stories\, improvisation\, and reflections about life in a way that is both hilarious and surprisingly emotional. His live shows go far beyond traditional stand-up — they are powerful live experiences filled with laughter and connection. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA one-of-a-kind comedy experience performed entirely in Portuguese\nSmart\, personal storytelling blended with improvisation\nHilarious and emotionally resonant moments throughout\nAn exclusive U.S. tour stop — limited performances nationwide\nA historic gathering of Brazilian comedy fans from across the country\nAn unforgettable night of laughter and connection\n\nVenue Information\nWells Hall at The Parker (Lillian S. Wells Hall) is a premier performing arts venue located at 707 NE 8th Street in Fort Lauderdale\, FL. The venue offers complimentary parking\, valet services\, premium club experiences (The Haller Club and The Place To Be)\, and full concessions. Accessible seating is available. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $57 and go up to $199 depending on seat location. There is an overall 9-ticket limit per order. Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
