DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n \nWhindersson Nunes LIVE at Wells Hall at The Parker\nOne of Brazil’s biggest comedy stars\, Whindersson Nunes\, returns to the United States for the first time in four years with his brand-new tour “Isso Definitivamente Não é um Culto” (“This Is Definitely Not a Cult”). Known for his unpredictable\, authentic style blending smart comedy\, personal stories\, and improvisation\, Whindersson delivers a powerful live experience that goes far beyond traditional stand-up. Don’t miss this historic U.S. tour stop in Fort Lauderdale! \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 2\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM\nVenue: Wells Hall at The Parker (Lillian S. Wells Hall)\nAddress: 707 NE 8th Street\, Fort Lauderdale\, FL 33304\nParking: Complimentary parking available; valet $10/vehicle\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome\nLanguage: This performance will be spoken in Portuguese \nAbout Whindersson Nunes\nWhindersson Nunes is recognized as one of the biggest Brazilian comedians in the world\, with a massive following across social media and sold-out tours across multiple continents. His unique style combines smart comedy\, personal stories\, improvisation\, and reflections about life in a way that is both hilarious and surprisingly emotional. After four years away from the U.S.\, he returns with his most ambitious tour yet. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA brand-new stand-up comedy show performed in Portuguese\nSmart\, authentic humor blending personal stories and improvisation\nHilarious and emotionally resonant moments throughout\nA powerful live experience unlike traditional stand-up\nOne of the most anticipated Brazilian comedy events in South Florida\nLimited tickets available — this show is expected to sell out\n\nVenue Information\nWells Hall at The Parker (Lillian S. Wells Hall) is a premier performing arts venue located at 707 NE 8th Street in Fort Lauderdale\, FL. The venue offers complimentary parking\, valet services\, premium club experiences (The Haller Club and The Place To Be)\, and full accessibility accommodations. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $57. This is a limited-capacity event and tickets are expected to sell out. Purchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
