SUMMARY:Mike Vecchione LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nMike Vecchione is a New York City-based comedian who has been performing in the city and across the country for more than 20 years. A former special education teacher\, Mike got his start in Philadelphia before moving to the Big Apple\, where he has earned the respect of the industry\, comedy clubs\, and his fellow comedians. \nMike has a sarcastic\, joke-heavy style combined with sharp writing and an understated delivery that leaves audiences in stitches. His one-hour special The Attractives\, directed and produced by friend and fellow comic Nate Bargatze\, was shot in Nashville and is one of the premiere comedy specials of 2023. He followed that up with his newest special Low Income White — a sharp\, fast-paced hour that delivers big laughs through everyday observations and personal quirks. \nMike Vecchione is widely regarded as one of the most precise and consistent joke writers in comedy today. His ability to craft perfectly structured jokes with unexpected punchlines is what sets him apart from the crowd. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Sunday\, August 2\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM CDT\nDoors Open: 6:00 PM CDT\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\nAddress: 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event — Valid photo ID required\n\nAbout the Venue\nLaugh Out Loud Comedy Club is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco — just inside the loop and only a few miles from the airport. \nThe club features a full bar lounge where guests can grab a drink before the show\, and a comfortable showroom with first-come\, first-served seating. Preferred Tables are located center stage for the best views\, while General Admission tables are positioned on the sides and wings. \nThere is a 2-item food or beverage minimum per person once seated\, and an 18% service charge applies to all checks in the showroom. Early arrival is strongly recommended to secure your preferred seating. \nWhat to Expect\nMike Vecchione delivers a masterclass in joke writing — every line is crafted with precision\, every punchline lands with impact. His sarcastic\, understated delivery makes the jokes hit even harder\, and his ability to find humor in the mundane details of everyday life is truly remarkable. \nThis is a solo headlining show in an intimate club setting. Fans of sharp\, well-crafted stand-up comedy will be thoroughly entertained from start to finish. Mike’s shows are consistently praised by both audiences and fellow comedians alike. \nDon’t miss this Sunday night show at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club — grab your tickets now! \nTicket Information\n\nGeneral Admission: $20 (+ fees)\nPreferred Seating: $30 (+ fees)\nOrder Limit: 10 tickets per order\n\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/mike-vecchione-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 Northwest Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX\, 78216\, USA
