SUMMARY:Nate Bargatze: Big Dumb Eyes World Tour LIVE at KeyBank Center
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nNate Bargatze is one of the hottest names in stand-up comedy today. Known as “The Great American” comedian\, Bargatze has built a massive following with his clean\, relatable humor that appeals to audiences of all ages and backgrounds. \nA Nashville native and son of a clown-turned-magician\, Nate’s comedy draws from his Southern upbringing\, family life\, and everyday observations. His Netflix specials — including The Tennessee Kid\, The Greatest Average American\, and Hello World — have made him one of the most-watched comedians on the platform. \nThe Big Dumb Eyes World Tour is his most ambitious tour yet\, bringing his signature laid-back storytelling style to arenas across the globe. Don’t miss your chance to see Nate Bargatze live in Buffalo! \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 2\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM \nVenue: KeyBank Center\, One Seymour H. Knox III Plaza\, Buffalo\, NY 14203 \nImportant: KEYBANK CENTER BAG POLICY — ALL BAGS\, BACKPACKS\, AND PURSES ARE PROHIBITED. Please plan accordingly. \nAbout the Venue\nKeyBank Center is Buffalo’s premier sports and entertainment arena\, home to the Buffalo Sabres NHL team. Located at One Seymour H. Knox III Plaza in downtown Buffalo\, the arena seats approximately 19\,000 for concerts and major events. \nThe venue offers a world-class entertainment experience with state-of-the-art sound and lighting systems\, multiple concession areas\, and excellent sightlines from every section. The arena is designed to deliver an immersive experience whether you’re in the lower bowl or the upper deck. \nKeyBank Center is easily accessible from downtown Buffalo and is served by multiple parking garages and surface lots nearby. The venue is also accessible via public transit. Note that all bags\, backpacks\, and purses are prohibited per venue policy — plan to travel light. \nWhat to Expect\nNate Bargatze’s arena shows are known for being family-friendly\, high-energy\, and laugh-out-loud funny from start to finish. His clean comedy style means this is a show you can bring the whole family to enjoy. \nExpect a full-length headlining set featuring all-new material from the Big Dumb Eyes World Tour. Bargatze’s storytelling is effortless and warm\, drawing you in with relatable tales before delivering perfectly timed punchlines that have the whole arena roaring. \nThis is a rescheduled show — all previously purchased tickets remain valid. Arrive early to find your seats and enjoy the pre-show atmosphere at KeyBank Center. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $45 – $150 (plus fees) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). This is a major arena show — get your tickets before they sell out. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour-live-at-keybank-center/
LOCATION:KeyBank Center\, One Seymour H. Knox III Plaza\, Buffalo\, NY\, 14203\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/969958b2-3e23-41ae-a1e8-8be73f5463af_CUSTOM-IMFUca.jpg
