SUMMARY:S.F. Comedy Showcase LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club - San Francisco
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nThe S.F. Comedy Showcase is San Francisco’s premier weekly stand-up comedy event\, hosted at the legendary Punch Line Comedy Club. Each showcase brings together a rotating lineup of some of the best local Bay Area comedians alongside nationally touring acts\, making every show a unique and unpredictable night of laughs. \nThe showcase has been a cornerstone of the San Francisco comedy scene for decades\, serving as a launching pad for emerging talent and a regular stop for established comics looking to work out new material. The format is fast-paced and diverse — expect multiple performers across a range of styles\, from sharp observational humor to storytelling\, crowd work\, and everything in between. \nWhether you’re a comedy superfan or just looking for a fun Sunday night out\, the S.F. Comedy Showcase delivers consistent\, high-quality entertainment in one of the city’s most beloved venues. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Sunday\, August 2\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\nAddress: 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94111\nAge Restriction: 18+ (2 Beverage Minimum)\nTicket Prices: From $21.80 (General Admission)\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Punch Line Comedy Club in San Francisco is one of the most iconic comedy venues on the West Coast. Nestled at 444 Battery Street in the Financial District\, this intimate club has been a cornerstone of the Bay Area comedy scene since the late 1970s. With a capacity of approximately 300 guests\, the room offers an up-close\, personal comedy experience that larger venues simply can’t match. \nThe club features tiered seating with cocktail tables\, a full bar\, and a warm\, inviting atmosphere that makes every show feel like a special occasion. The stage is low and close to the audience\, creating an electric connection between performers and the crowd. Parking is available in nearby garages on Battery and Front Streets\, and the venue is conveniently located near the Embarcadero BART station. \nThe Punch Line is an 18+ venue with a two-drink minimum. Doors typically open 60–90 minutes before showtime\, so arrive early to grab a great seat and a drink before the laughs begin. \nWhat to Expect\nThe S.F. Comedy Showcase is a multi-comedian lineup show\, meaning you’ll see several performers take the stage throughout the evening. Each comic brings their own unique voice and style\, creating a dynamic\, varied night of entertainment that keeps the energy high from start to finish. \nThis is the perfect event for groups\, date nights\, or anyone looking to discover new comedy talent. The showcase format means there’s something for everyone — whether you prefer sharp one-liners\, long-form storytelling\, or high-energy crowd interaction. Expect approximately 90 minutes of non-stop comedy in one of San Francisco’s most beloved rooms. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $21.80 for General Admission (18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum). Preferred Premium seating is also available. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/sf-comedy-showcase-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-san-francisco/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\, 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, California\, 94111\, United States Of America
